<title>USA: J. Ray McDermott delays annual meeting.</title>
<headline>J. Ray McDermott delays annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>NEW ORLEANS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>J. Ray McDermott SA said Friday its directors voted to reschedule its annual meeting to allow more time to mail proxy materials to stockholders.</p>
<p>The meeting, originally set for August 1, was moved to August 29, the marine construction company said in a statement.</p>
<p>The company added that the proxy materials, including its annual report, may be delayed because it was unable to obtain audited financial statements of a foreign unconsolidated affiliate.</p>
